\n<p>网站地址：<a href=\"https://yan.plus/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://yan.plus/</a></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>注册邮箱目前仅支持 Gmail 、163 邮箱和 QQ 邮箱。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>评论注册 ID ，每人赠送 <strong>$5 额度</strong>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>加入 Q 群并私聊管理员，再赠送 <strong>$5 额度</strong>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>网站目前暂不支持充值。如果赠送的 <strong>$10 额度</strong>用完了，可以私聊管理员会再送一些额度。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>迫于 NewAPI 原生 UI 太丑了，直接鞭策 GPT 重新改了一版。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>发现 Bug ，还会赠送额外额度。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>暂时就这些。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n", "last_modified": 1788745357, "replies": 99, "id": 1239922}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4f28/4803/1187_large.png?m=1773123999", "name": "codex", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4f28/4803/1187_normal.png?m=1773123999", "title": "Codex", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/codex", "topics": 423, "footer": "", "header": "Codex 是 OpenAI 开发的面向软件工程的人工智能系统，能够将自然语言指令转换为可执行代码，并协助完成多种编程任务。", "title_alternative": "Codex", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/4f28/4803/1187_mini.png?m=1773123999", "stars": 203, "founder_id": 559063, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 1187, "parent_node_name": null}, "member": {"id": 630450, "username": "snownemo", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/snownemo", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9569a2290b77bb5188f766e97022161a?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9569a2290b77bb5188f766e97022161a?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9569a2290b77bb5188f766e97022161a?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1684842323, "last_modified": 1750124021, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "freefreef", "last_touched": 1788757621, "title": "Codex 又有 1000 邀请额度了，有条件的留邮箱", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1239902", "created": 1788742345, "deleted": 0, "content": "https://i.imgur.com/gbdXUZE.png", "content_rendered": "<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/gbdXUZE.png\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gbdXUZE.png\" class=\"embedded_image\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a>", "last_modified": 1788742345, "replies": 95, "id": 1239902}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/70ef/df2e/17_large.png?m=1660301119", "name": "create", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/70ef/df2e/17_normal.png?m=1660301119", "title": "分享创造", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/create", "topics": 36365, "footer": "", "header": "欢迎你在这里发布自己的最新作品！", "title_alternative": "Create", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/70ef/df2e/17_mini.png?m=1660301119", "stars": 6175, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 17, "parent_node_name": "geek"}, "member": {"id": 453922, "username": "x1shir", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/x1shir", "website": null, "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": null, "tagline": null, "bio": null, "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3bdfd0c9ffbbf866da5f5b31a977b92d?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3bdfd0c9ffbbf866da5f5b31a977b92d?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/3bdfd0c9ffbbf866da5f5b31a977b92d?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1574076020, "last_modified": 1776495869, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "Danta0", "last_touched": 1788757961, "title": "[送兑换码] 做了一个苹果 APP，送一些永久会员兑换码", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1239883", "created": 1788716942, "deleted": 0, "content": "我的相册和大多数人一样，有几万张照片，视频、录屏、截图、连拍、随手拍混在一起，一直想整理，一直没动过。\r\n\r\n后来我发现自己其实挺有耐心的——刷抖音能刷一小时。那如果相册也能这么刷呢？\r\n\r\n所以我做了「刷相册」(Photoks)：\r\n\r\n\r\n![刷相册]( https://photoks.app/img/zh/shot-feed.webp)\r\n\r\n- 随机刷出相册里的老照片，像刷短视频一样一张一张划\r\n- 看到不想要的，随手标记删除，攒一批确认后一次删掉\r\n- 不做分类、没有复杂功能，就是刷\r\n\r\n没有算法推荐，没有通知，没有账号系统。它唯一的目的是让你刷相册，顺便清理一下照片/视频。\r\n\r\nApp 免费下载，Pro 是一次性买断。我给 V 友们准备了 50 个 Pro 永久会员兑换码，想要的直接在评论区留言邮箱，我会邮件发送兑换码，先到先得送完为止。\r\n\r\n提醒：App 没有上架中国大陆区，需要非国区的 Apple ID 才能下载和兑换。\r\n\r\nApp Store： https://apps.apple.com/app/photoks-swipe-clean-photos/id6806786997\r\n\r\n官网： [刷相册 APP]( https://photoks.app/zh/)", "content_rendered": "<p>我的相册和大多数人一样，有几万张照片，视频、录屏、截图、连拍、随手拍混在一起，一直想整理，一直没动过。</p>\n<p>后来我发现自己其实挺有耐心的——刷抖音能刷一小时。那如果相册也能这么刷呢？</p>\n<p>所以我做了「刷相册」(Photoks)：</p>\n<p><img alt=\"刷相册\" class=\"embedded_image\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" rel=\"noreferrer\" src=\"https://photoks.app/img/zh/shot-feed.webp\"/></p>\n<ul>\n<li>随机刷出相册里的老照片，像刷短视频一样一张一张划</li>\n<li>看到不想要的，随手标记删除，攒一批确认后一次删掉</li>\n<li>不做分类、没有复杂功能，就是刷</li>\n</ul>\n<p>没有算法推荐，没有通知，没有账号系统。它唯一的目的是让你刷相册，顺便清理一下照片/视频。</p>\n<p>App 免费下载，Pro 是一次性买断。我给 V 友们准备了 50 个 Pro 永久会员兑换码，想要的直接在评论区留言邮箱，我会邮件发送兑换码，先到先得送完为止。</p>\n<p>提醒：App 没有上架中国大陆区，需要非国区的 Apple ID 才能下载和兑换。</p>\n<p>App Store： <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/photoks-swipe-clean-photos/id6806786997\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://apps.apple.com/app/photoks-swipe-clean-photos/id6806786997</a></p>\n<p>官网： <a href=\"https://photoks.app/zh/\" rel=\"nofollow\">刷相册 APP</a></p>\n", "last_modified": 1788717210, "replies": 84, "id": 1239883}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/38af/8613/176_large.png?m=1644885960", "name": "car", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/38af/8613/176_normal.png?m=1644885960", "title": "汽车", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/car", "topics": 3296, "footer": "", "header": "关于买车、开车及汽车文化的技术讨论", "title_alternative": "Car", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/38af/8613/176_mini.png?m=1644885960", "stars": 2296, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 176, "parent_node_name": "life"}, "member": {"id": 411532, "username": "clacf", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/clacf", "website": "", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9a5af21f8dc33efc660faf5fb6b18aff?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9a5af21f8dc33efc660faf5fb6b18aff?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/9a5af2