84621_xxxlarge.png?m=1730920764", "created": 1469856014, "last_modified": 1730920764, "pro": 0}, "last_reply_by": "fanjinzhongju952", "last_touched": 1788758641, "title": "我发现一句对人生帮助巨大的 prompt， GPT 给我的回答好到我打算拿来当座右铭", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/t/1239906", "created": 1788743229, "deleted": 0, "content": "很短就一句话：\r\n\r\n**“基于我们所有的聊天内容，请告诉我一个你认为我非常有必要知道，但大概率还不知道的知识。”**\r\n\r\n本来只是随手一问，看到回答有种被瞬间戳中的感觉，它完全把我的性格缺点指了出来，\r\n\r\n这是我的答案，每个人的情况不一样，看别人的答案可能不觉得有什么，强烈建议自己试试。\r\n\r\nhttps://i.imgur.com/L8JIiND.png", "content_rendered": "<p>很短就一句话：</p>\n<p><strong>“基于我们所有的聊天内容，请告诉我一个你认为我非常有必要知道，但大概率还不知道的知识。”</strong></p>\n<p>本来只是随手一问，看到回答有种被瞬间戳中的感觉，它完全把我的性格缺点指了出来，</p>\n<p>这是我的答案，每个人的情况不一样，看别人的答案可能不觉得有什么，强烈建议自己试试。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://i.imgur.com/L8JIiND.png\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://i.imgur.com/L8JIiND.png</a></p>\n", "last_modified": 1788743229, "replies": 73, "id": 1239906}, {"node": {"avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_large.png?m=1777132346", "name": "qna", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_normal.png?m=1777132346", "title": "问与答", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/go/qna", "topics": 241374, "footer": "", "header": "<!--\r\n一个更好的世界需要你持续地提出好问题。\r\n-->", "title_alternative": "Questions and Answers", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/navatar/c20a/d4d7/12_mini.png?m=1777132346", "stars": 4512, "founder_id": 0, "aliases": [], "root": false, "id": 12, "parent_node_name": "v2ex"}, "member": {"id": 666025, "username": "test848", "url": "https://www.v2ex.com/u/test848", "website": "", "twitter": null, "psn": null, "github": null, "btc": null, "location": "", "tagline": "", "bio": "", "avatar_mini": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/df376cf9b6a04bd3754fb248f5801015?s=24&d=retro", "avatar_normal": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/df376cf9b6a04bd3754fb248f5801015?s=48&d=retro", "avatar_large": "https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/df376cf9b6a04bd3754fb248f5801015?s=73&d=retro", "created": 1701923086, "last_modified": 1781484517, "pro": 0}, "last_re